OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over taxi drivers losing
OL,4,Awork after break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of taxi drivers in West Sussex
OL,7,Fare losing business after their cars
OL,8,Fwere damaged in a spate of break-ins,
OL,9,Fthe BBC has been told.
OL,11,FTaxi firms in Crawley said they felt
OL,12,Fthey were being targeted, with one
OL,13,Fbusiness reporting 14 break-ins in just
OL,14,Fone weekend.
OL,16,FLakiem Khan, owner of Metro Cars, which
OL,17,Fis based in the town, said drivers were
OL,18,Funable to work for two to three days
OL,19,Fwhile the damage was being repaired.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
