OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over taxi drivers losing
OL,4,Awork after break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupt Rachel Glenton, from Sussex
OL,7,FPolice, said: "As a result of the
OL,8,Fproactive activities that we have
OL,9,Fcompleted over the past week or so, we
OL,10,Fhave arrested three suspects."
